{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/app\/architecture"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Architecture-Diagram","text":"Architecture Diagram"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Visually, the architecture can be described as:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"HighLevelArchitecture"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each of the components above are the following:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Checksum Client. This can be found in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"ChecksumClient","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" module, and is an abstraction of a SHA256 checksum.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"GithubAPIClient. This is an abstraction of the minimal set of Github API endpoints that we need. The public","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"API can be found in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"GithubAPIClient","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" module, and the implementation can be found in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"GithubAPIClientImpl","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" module.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Github OpenAPI Codegen. This can be found in the "},{"code":"GithubOpenAPI","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" module. It uses the "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/apple\/swift-openapi-generator","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Swift Package Manager plugin to generate code from the Github API."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For all of our clients, we use the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/pointfreeco\/swift-dependencies"},{"text":" style of clients.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Swift-Package-Registry-Service-endpoints","text":"Swift Package Registry Service endpoints"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"As described ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/swiftlang\/swift-package-manager\/blob\/main\/Documentation\/PackageRegistry\/Registry.md#4-endpoints"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a Swift Package Registry Service must implement 6 endpoints:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"List Package Releases (","type":"text"},{"code":"GET \/{scope}\/{name}","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Fetch Release Metadata ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GET \/{scope}\/{name}\/{version}"},{"type":"text","text":")"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Fetch Manifest ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GET \/{scope}\/{name}\/{version}\/Package.swift"},{"type":"text","text":")"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Download Source Archive ("},{"code":"GET \/{scope}\/{name}\/{version}.zip","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Lookup Package Identifiers (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GET \/identifiers?url="},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Create Package Release ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PUT \/{scope}\/{name}\/{version}"},{"type":"text","text":")"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"However, the Create Package Release endpoint is optional. From the spec:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["Support for this endpoint is OPTIONAL. A server SHOULD indicate that publishing isn't supported by responding with a status code of 405 (Method Not Allowed)."],"syntax":null},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Since we are only interested in our service being a read-only service, then we do not support publishing, and thus the Create Package Release"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"endpoint always returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"405 Method Not Allowed"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The sections which follow provide more detail into the implementation of each of the endpoints.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"List-Package-Releases-implementation","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"List Package Releases implementation"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The List Packages Releases (","type":"text"},{"code":"GET \/{scope}\/{name}","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") endpoint is implemented as follows:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Do checks to validate the input parameters (package scope, package name, and Accept header)."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Check the memory cache for tag information for this package:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If there is cached tag information and it is less than 5 minutes old, then use it to construct the response."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Otherwise, we proceed to step 3 to refresh the memory-cached tag information.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Attempt to read the cached tag information from the disk cache. If the age"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the disk-cached tag information is less than 30 minutes old, then use to to construct"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the response. Otherwise, proceed to step 4 to refresh the disk-cached tag information."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If we have at least one tag in the disk-cache, then call the Github API","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/docs.github.com\/en\/rest\/repos\/repos?apiVersion=2022-11-28#list-repository-tags","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"endpoint to fetch the latest tag. If the latest tag was present in the disk cache,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"then we know the disk cache is up-to-date and we use the tag information","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in the disk cache to construct the response. Otherwise, we proceed to step 5.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Next, using the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/docs.github.com\/en\/rest\/repos\/repos?apiVersion=2022-11-28#list-repository-tags","type":"reference","isActive":true,"overridingTitle":"List Repository Tags","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"List Repository Tags"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"endpoint, we fetch all of the tags for this repository, one page at a time."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Next we compute the mapping from semantic version to tags."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Next we write out the list of tags and the version-to-tag mapping to disk cache."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then we return the list of semantic versions in the response."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"anchor":"Fetch-Release-Metadata-Implementation","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Fetch Release Metadata Implementation"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There is currently no API in the Github API to return the SHA256 checksum"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of a source archive. Some developers have written Github Actions like "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/marketplace\/actions\/sha256-checksum","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/jmgilman\/actions-generate-checksum","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". So therefore,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"since the source archive checksum is part of the Release Metadata information,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"then we have to download the source archive and computes its checksum before"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"responding."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The Fetch Release Metadata (","type":"text"},{"code":"GET \/{scope}\/{name}\/{version}","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") endpoint is implemented as follows:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Do checks to validate the input parameters (package scope, package name, package version,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and Accept header).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Check the memory cache for release metadata for this package. If it is present,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"then use it to construct the response. Otherwise, go to step 3.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Check the disk cache for release metadata for this package. If it is present,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"then use it to constrct the response. Otherwise, go to step 4."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Do steps 2-8 from the List Package Releases to fetch the tag information for this respository."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Find the tag which corresponds to the input semantic version.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/docs.github.com\/en\/rest\/releases\/releases?apiVersion=2022-11-28#get-a-release-by-tag-name"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Github API endpoint to find the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"publishedAt"},{"type":"text","text":" date for this tag. It is not an error"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"if no release is associated with that tag. In that case, we simply don’t provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"publishedAt"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Date"},{"type":"text","text":" in the response."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Next we download the source archive for this tag to disk."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Next we compute the SHA256 checksum for this source archive.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Next we save the version and its associated tag, the SHA256 checksum, and the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"publishedAt"},{"type":"text","text":" date"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the disk cache."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Then we return this same information and construct the response.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"anchor":"Fetch-Manifest-Implementation","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Fetch Manifest Implementation"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The Fetch Manifest (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GET \/{scope}\/{name}\/{version}\/Package?swift-version="},{"text":") endpoint","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is implemented as follows:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Do checks to validate the input parameters (package scope, package name, package version,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and Accept Header)."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Check the memory cache for manifest information for this package version. If it is present,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"then skip to step 11 to return the response.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Check the disk cache for manifest information for this package version. If it is present,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"then skip to step 11 to return the response.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Do steps 2-8 from the List Package Releases to fetch the tag information for this respository."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Look up the tag for the input semantic version."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/docs.github.com\/en\/rest\/repos\/contents?apiVersion=2022-11-28#get-repository-content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Github API endpoint to fetch the directory contents of the root of the repository."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Look through the filenames of the files in the respository root to find all of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the package manifests. If we don’t find any, then return a 404 Not Found."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"overridingTitle":"Get Repository Content","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"text":"Get Repository Content","type":"text"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/docs.github.com\/en\/rest\/repos\/contents?apiVersion=2022-11-28#get-repository-content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Github API endpoint to fetch each of the package manifests found in step 7."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For each of the manifests, parse out the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swift-tools-version"},{"type":"text","text":" found at the top"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of each manifest."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Save each of the manifests to disk cache, and save the list of manifests (along with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"their ","type":"text"},{"code":"swift-tools-version","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") to disk.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If had a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swift-version"},{"text":" query parameter in the request, then find the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"corresponding package manifest in the manifest information, and return that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"manifest. If there was no swift-version-specific package manifest corresponding","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the specified ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swift-version"},{"text":", then return a 303 See Other response,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the Location header pointing to the un-versioned package manifest.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If we did not have a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swift-version"},{"text":" query parameter in the request,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"then look up the un-versioned package manifest in the manifest information,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and return it. Include any information about the other swift-version-specific","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"manifests in the Link header.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"anchor":"Download-Source-Archive-Implementation","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Download Source Archive Implementation"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Download Source Archive ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GET \/{scope}\/{name}\/{version}.zip"},{"type":"text","text":") endpoint is implemented"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as follows:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Do checks to validate the input parameters (package scope, package name, package version,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Accept header)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Do steps 2-10 in the Fetch Release Metadata implementation to fetch"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"release metadata. This will also result in the source archive for the specified"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"version being downloaded."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Read the source archive from disk and return it in the response.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"anchor":"Lookup-Package-Identifiers-Implementation","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Lookup Package Identifiers Implementation"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Lookup Package Identifiers ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GET \/identifiers?url="},{"type":"text","text":") endpoint is implemented"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as follows:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Do checks to validate the input parameters ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"url"},{"type":"text","text":" query parameter and Accept header)"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Parse the input "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"url"},{"type":"text","text":" query parameter. It must be in one of the following three forms."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If it is not, then return a 404 Not Found."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An “HTML URL” of the form ","type":"text"},{"code":"https:\/\/github.com\/<scope>\/<name>","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A “Clone URL” of the form ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/github.com\/<scope>\/<name>.git"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An “SSH URL” of the form "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"git@github.com:<scope>\/<name>.git"}]}]}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Check the memory cache for a package ID for this URL. If it is present,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"then return it in the response. Otherwise, go to step 4.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Check the database for a cached Repository which has a clone URL, HTML URL, or SSH URL"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"equal to the input URL. If we find it, then return the package ID of this repository."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Otherwise, go to step 5."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Call the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/docs.github.com\/en\/rest\/repos\/repos?apiVersion=2022-11-28#get-a-repository"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Github API endpoint to fetch information for this repository. If this API call","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"returns 404 Not Found, then we also return 404 Not Found. Otherwise, go to step 6.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Save the Repository information returned by the Github API to the database."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Return the package ID of the Repository returned by the Gitub API."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/App\/documentation\/App\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/App\/documentation\/App\/ConfiguringSPM","doc:\/\/App\/documentation\/App\/GithubAPI","doc:\/\/App\/documentation\/App\/SpecificationSupport"],"anchor":"Essentials","generated":true,"title":"Essentials"}],"sections":[],"kind":"article","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/App\/documentation\/App\/Architecture","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/App\/documentation\/App"]]},"metadata":{"title":"Architecture","modules":[{"name":"App"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This article describes the architecture of the Swift Package Registry Service."}],"references":{"https://github.com/apple/swift-openapi-generator":{"titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"swift-openapi-generator"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/apple\/swift-openapi-generator","type":"link","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/apple\/swift-openapi-generator","title":"swift-openapi-generator"},"doc://App/documentation/App/GithubAPI":{"role":"article","kind":"article","type":"topic","title":"Github API","url":"\/documentation\/app\/githubapi","abstract":[{"text":"We can implement a Swift Package Registry Service by using these four operations in the Github API:","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/App\/documentation\/App\/GithubAPI"},"https://github.com/swiftlang/swift-package-manager/blob/main/Documentation/PackageRegistry/Registry.md#4-endpoints":{"titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"here"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/swiftlang\/swift-package-manager\/blob\/main\/Documentation\/PackageRegistry\/Registry.md#4-endpoints","type":"link","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/swiftlang\/swift-package-manager\/blob\/main\/Documentation\/PackageRegistry\/Registry.md#4-endpoints","title":"here"},"https://github.com/marketplace/actions/sha256-checksum":{"titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"this"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/marketplace\/actions\/sha256-checksum","type":"link","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/marketplace\/actions\/sha256-checksum","title":"this"},"https://github.com/jmgilman/actions-generate-checksum":{"titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"this"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/jmgilman\/actions-generate-checksum","type":"link","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/jmgilman\/actions-generate-checksum","title":"this"},"doc://App/documentation/App":{"title":"App","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/app","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/App\/documentation\/App","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"The Swift Package Registry Service is a Vapor-based web service which implements the Swift Package Registry Service Specification by proxying and caching the Github API.","type":"text"}]},"doc://App/documentation/App/ConfiguringSPM":{"url":"\/documentation\/app\/configuringspm","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Learn how to configure your Swift Package Manager to use the package registry.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/App\/documentation\/App\/ConfiguringSPM","title":"Configuring Swift Package Manager","kind":"article","role":"article"},"HighLevelArchitecture":{"identifier":"HighLevelArchitecture","type":"image","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/App\/HighLevelArchitecture.png"}],"alt":"Image of Service High-Level Architecture"},"doc://App/documentation/App/SpecificationSupport":{"role":"article","kind":"article","type":"topic","title":"Specification Support","abstract":[{"text":"See the status of each feature in the Swift Package Registry Service specification.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/App\/documentation\/App\/SpecificationSupport","url":"\/documentation\/app\/specificationsupport"},"https://docs.github.com/en/rest/repos/repos?apiVersion=2022-11-28#list-repository-tags":{"titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"List Repository Tags"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/docs.github.com\/en\/rest\/repos\/repos?apiVersion=2022-11-28#list-repository-tags","type":"link","url":"https:\/\/docs.github.com\/en\/rest\/repos\/repos?apiVersion=2022-11-28#list-repository-tags","title":"List Repository Tags"},"https://docs.github.com/en/rest/repos/contents?apiVersion=2022-11-28#get-repository-content":{"titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Get Repository Content"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/docs.github.com\/en\/rest\/repos\/contents?apiVersion=2022-11-28#get-repository-content","type":"link","url":"https:\/\/docs.github.com\/en\/rest\/repos\/contents?apiVersion=2022-11-28#get-repository-content","title":"Get Repository Content"},"https://docs.github.com/en/rest/releases/releases?apiVersion=2022-11-28#get-a-release-by-tag-name":{"titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Get A Release By Tag Name"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/docs.github.com\/en\/rest\/releases\/releases?apiVersion=2022-11-28#get-a-release-by-tag-name","type":"link","url":"https:\/\/docs.github.com\/en\/rest\/releases\/releases?apiVersion=2022-11-28#get-a-release-by-tag-name","title":"Get A Release By Tag Name"},"https://docs.github.com/en/rest/repos/repos?apiVersion=2022-11-28#get-a-repository":{"titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Get Repository"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/docs.github.com\/en\/rest\/repos\/repos?apiVersion=2022-11-28#get-a-repository","type":"link","url":"https:\/\/docs.github.com\/en\/rest\/repos\/repos?apiVersion=2022-11-28#get-a-repository","title":"Get Repository"},"https://github.com/pointfreeco/swift-dependencies":{"titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"swift-dependencies"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/